WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.750
Flower: Alibi is a party game about your friends.

00:02.750 --> 00:05.000
Flower: Make up lies. Guess what’s true.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.650
Frog: Join on your phone, choose your character, and play.

00:08.650 --> 00:10.000
Frog: No downloads.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.100
Flower: One friend tells the truth.

00:12.100 --> 00:14.400
Flower: Everyone else makes up an answer.

00:14.400 --> 00:16.600
Cowboy: Earn points by guessing correctly—

00:16.600 --> 00:19.000
Cowboy: or getting friends to believe you.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
Cape: Next, write questions about each other.

00:22.000 --> 00:25.000
Cape: Secret roles give you special abilities.

00:25.000 --> 00:27.500
Flower: Final round: one player answers a question.

00:27.500 --> 00:29.750
Flower: Only one artist sees their answer.

00:29.750 --> 00:32.000
Flower: Everyone else draws a guess.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Frog: Which drawing came from the artist who knew?

00:36.000 --> 00:40.650
Cape: The game handles timers, scores, and keeping answers private.

00:40.650 --> 00:42.100
Frog: Accidentally refreshed?

00:42.100 --> 00:44.000
Cape: You can rejoin.

00:44.000 --> 00:47.000
Flower: Three rounds. Your friends. Plenty of questionable answers.

00:47.000 --> 00:50.000
Cowboy: Think you know each other? Let’s find out.
